      "endMs": 77590,
      "durationMs": 1910
    },
    {
      "startMs": 77590,
      "text": "这双手正是属于你自己的",
      "endMs": 80340,
      "durationMs": 2750
    },
    {
      "startMs": 80340,
      "text": "一切应该都能改换一新",
      "endMs": 82000,
      "durationMs": 1660
    },
    {
      "startMs": 82000,
      "text": "就此伸出手吧",
      "endMs": 88990,
      "durationMs": 6990
    },
    {
      "startMs": 88990,
      "text": "本是为了不让我迷失于永恒而存在的温暖",
      "endMs": 93070,
      "durationMs": 4080
    },
    {
      "startMs": 93070,
      "text": "面对轻率的你",
      "endMs": 94710,
      "durationMs": 1640
    },
    {
      "startMs": 94710,
      "text": "却因无法传达心意而消散殆尽",
      "endMs": 97230,
      "durationMs": 2520
    },
    {
      "startMs": 97230,
      "text": "一如想象？ 根本不可能如此",
      "endMs": 101440,
      "durationMs": 4210
    },
    {
      "startMs": 101440,
      "text": "只要逃避就可以了吗？",
      "endMs": 103140,
      "durationMs": 1700
    },
    {
      "startMs": 103140,
      "text": "不要说得那么轻易",
      "endMs": 106050,
      "durationMs": 2910
    },
    {
      "startMs": 106050,
      "text": "我今天依然驰骋于",
      "endMs": 108890,
      "durationMs": 2840
    },
    {
      "startMs": 108890,
      "text": "这个一如既往的世界之中",
      "endMs": 111260,
      "durationMs": 2370
    },
    {
      "startMs": 111260,
      "text": "若你中途滑落我会紧紧抓住你",
      "endMs": 113720,
      "durationMs": 2460
    },
    {
      "startMs": 113720,
      "text": "让灰色的天空中闪烁着蔚蓝之色吧",
      "endMs": 127960,
      "durationMs": 14240
